              }
            ],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir dizideki her öğenin index adı verilen numaralandırılmış bir konumu vardır.</p><img src=\"841bb221-569c-4748-ab76-f5261dcadd13\" visible-if=\"always\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Start at zero",
            "id": 73665,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizinler 0'dan başlar ve sonraki her değerle birlikte artar. Bu, <code>temperatures</code> dizisindeki ikinci öğenin <code>1</code> dizininde olduğu anlamına gelir. O dizini kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"20\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Access element",
            "id": 73666,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>26</code> gibi bir öğeye erişmek için <code>temperatures</code> dizi adını, ardından köşeli parantezler içinde öğenin dizinini <code>[2]</code> kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"26\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temperatures</code>, ardından <code>[</code> ve sonra <code>2</code>, <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>26</code> gibi bir öğeye erişmek için <code>temperatures</code> dizi adının ardından köşeli parantezler arasında öğenin dizinini <code>[2]</code> kodla. Üçüncü ölçümü yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"temperatures[2]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"26\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temperatures</code>, ardından <code>[</code>, <code>2</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Change value",
            "id": 73668,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkinci indisteki sıcaklık değerini güncellemek için <code>temperatures[2]</code> üzerinden ona eriş, ardından <code>=</code> kullanarak <code>25</code> gibi yeni bir değer ata.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temperatures);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 17, 20, 25, 24 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temperatures[2]</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>25</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkinci dizindeki sıcaklık değerini güncellemek için ona <code>temperatures[2]</code> üzerinden eriş, ardından <code>=</code> kullanarak <code>25</code> gibi yeni bir değer ata. Üçüncü ölçümü <code>25</code> yap.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temperatures);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"26\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 17, 20, 25, 24 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>temperatures[2]</code> ve son olarak <code>25</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Valid index",
            "id": 73667,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizide dört öğe olmasına rağmen erişebileceğimiz son indeks <code>3</code>'tür; çünkü indeksleme 0'dan başlar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(temperatures);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 17, 25, 26, 20 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizi indeksleri <code>0</code>'dan başlar, bu yüzden dört öğeli bir dizinin son indeksi <code>3</code>'tür.</p><p>Bir öğeye <code>temperatures[0]</code> gibi köşeli parantez içindeki indeksiyle eriş. Güncellemek için <code>=</code> kullan.</p><p>Üçüncü ölçümü <code>20</code> olarak güncelle.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 17, 25, 20, 24 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>2</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
