            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu dizide <code>\"Kim\"</code> öğesinden önce <code>\"Lee\"</code> eklediğini düşün. Hangi indeks artık <code>\"Kim\"</code> öğesini getirir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friends = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Kim&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
