            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Gösterilen dizideki orta öğe olan <code>\"Tesla\"</code> değerine hangi ifade erişir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cars = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Fiat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tesla&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Saab&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>cars[1]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>cars[\"Tesla\"]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>cars[2]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>cars[1]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
